OL,3,GNEWSASatellite company set for
OL,4,Alow-orbit mission in 2028
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Reading company that makes satellites
OL,7,Fdesigned to be positioned close to the
OL,8,FEarth has said it will launch its first
OL,9,Fmodel in two years.
OL,11,FNewOrbit's satellites will be built to
OL,12,Foperate between 200 and 300km (124 and
OL,13,F186 miles) above Earth, about
OL,14,Ftwo-to-three times closer than most
OL,15,Fsatellites.
OL,17,FThe company, based in Caversham, said
OL,18,Foperating at that altitude had been
OL,19,Fdifficult because of atmospheric drag
OL,20,Fon the satellite and other conditions.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,333,330,200,160,0,100
