OL,3,GNEWSASatellite company set for
OL,4,Alow-orbit mission in 2028
OL,5,
OL,6,FIt said its Very Low Earth Orbit (VLEO)
OL,7,Fmission, called NEO-1, was scheduled
OL,8,Ffor between July and September 2028.
